  "_comment": [
    "Naver Smart Editor One selectors.",
    "Naming rule: {context}_{element}_{variant?}",
    "  context : overlay | toolbar | editor | library | publish | heading | quote | divider | size | bold",
    "  element : what it is (title, body, paragraph, image, btn ...)",
    "  variant : state or qualifier (cancel, confirm, close, selected ...)",
    "locators are ordered most-stable → least-stable.",
    "TODO entries use CSS stubs — run capture_selectors.py --merge to update."
